\newlabel{tbl:framework_capability}{{2}{15}{Model kinds each render framework supports, read entirely from the flags in \protect \breaktt {src/gnn/render/framework\_registry.py} --- the same source as tbl.~\ref {tbl:backend_registry}. A continuous cell of \protect \texttt {unsupported} is the renderer's own status for continuous-state models; continuous-only targets do not render categorical models. An executor entry declares dispatch support, not acceptance of every model or inference mode; a render-only entry has no Step-12 executor. Read with tbl.~1, which groups the same flags by model kind}{tbl:framework_capability}{}}
\@writefile{snm}{\beamer@slide {tbl:framework_capability}{15}}
